{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-02_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-02","title":"變節之刃","storyCode":"7-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"faedb885bcda24644faac9e1d35864a21d5fe7ad3bc3c60254eceaca7ec277e1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門上城區 7:00 p.m. 天開始黑了"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"秘密逮捕令？陳sir？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"搞錯了吧？怎麼可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！回來！我問你是不是搞錯了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，陳sir，怎麼會......究竟是誰在搞鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"必須得找到陳sir，親口問她才行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。我曉得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰尾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主人還有什麼吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有了。把之前我吩咐過的事情，都處理好。做完以後就趕緊去避避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰尾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。快去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——唉。居然還有人能算倒魏彥吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，塔露拉......難道說這真是命數？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"二少爺，你要是泉下有知，也不會想看到這般光景吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了，罷了。龍門終歸還是走到這步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但暉潔......暉潔！小心啊，暉潔......千萬別把命送了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmenbridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門停艦接舷區  7:20 p.m."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊！唔，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這個數量，真不是說說的......近衛局還沒掃蕩到這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天整合運動來一次，今天特殊感染者又來一次，就算是我們也頂不太住啊，又不能在城市裡使用大規格武器......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，幹員。他們是這次的敵人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！哎，有救了有救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都是被源石技藝轉化的感染者......？沒辦法限制住他們的活動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我們配備的大多是些防禦裝備，沒想到連鋼索和高纖維網都對付不了他們，對上這些感染者，恐怕要用戰爭用軍械才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"防線的壓力實在太大，沒辦法，我們只能向本艦請求支援。幸虧來的是你，現在我們有辦法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他們體內的源石結構把他們的身體變得很堅韌，我們得用可控重火力去限制他們的行動。另外......我們檢測不到他們的大腦活動的跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"根據觀察對比，他們似乎......實質上，已經死亡了。現在的他們純粹是被某種支配性法術驅動的。哎，太過分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"做出這種事的人......要付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你們的安全更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我制定計劃吧，我來......讓他們的躁動停下。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你要參與戰鬥？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可你看起來......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士......你沒見過迷迭香是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請讓一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可得小心，站遠一點。這一定是你第一次見這種架勢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"放在艙門裡的鐵盒飛起來了？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"漂浮在空中的器械，是你的裝備？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員，請向我描述一下目標的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解，我查下交流手冊......嗯，目標是，呃，表徵活躍的大量不安個體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"集群活動，缺乏有效目標，趨勢明顯，既定路徑不明。大致就這些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"——我知道了。請交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生叮囑過，在處理結束以後，要讓羅德島本艦立刻離開龍門......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好啊，老陳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊......？你怎麼在這，你的傷怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是鬼啊。那點小傷，早就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，你是在這等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你推著的這架沙地車，是不是雷姆必拓那款最新型？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“越野，爬坡，防塵，高續航低耗能，最小的環境影響，最大的駕駛享受？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好意思。終端上看多了，一不小心就把廣告詞記得滾瓜爛熟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是架好車，就算我對越野不感興趣，也想過要買一台呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"風塵僕僕的，老陳，你想往哪裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你會知道我在這裡......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你私下出城的時候都會從這裡走。哪有缺口，哪有別人不知道的通道，你我都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——近衛局已經發了通緝令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那肯定。你是什麼樣的人，我再清楚不過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只有從這條路才能出龍門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我躲躲藏藏了一路。如果近衛局的人都像你一樣懂道理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就絕不可能出得了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們和我一樣，不希望你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊......你要攔我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼你也要攔我，星熊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然要攔你，老陳。我是龍門近衛局的督察，更是你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是想來次千里單騎的英雄大冒險？不能放你出城的原因，也就這一個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是龍門人，星熊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經沒有其他機會了，再由魏彥吾用他的手段解決這事，只會犧牲更多人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那用你的方法就能解決了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們叫你鬼姐，他們相信你能保護得了他們熱愛的龍門。星熊，放我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，他們真的熱愛龍門嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我啊，是個老套的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"漫畫，電影，酒，下著雨的街道，匆匆路過的沒帶傘的人。除了電單車，我都喜歡老套的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"有些東西在別人看來是很容易過時的。但老陳，我們真能追得上時間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。我做不到。它走得太快了，它把我看重的許多東西都踩成了碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的，只有這麼多。一道劃痕，一個折角，一片黃斑，每一個我都能說上名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭它。我討厭時間帶走我身邊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都為了自己的一處容身之地粉身碎骨，我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著他們一個個消失，被捶打成齏粉，甚至是我動的手，他們的夢想被我親手砸得粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不是愛著龍門。他們是無處容身。最後的最後，也是我讓他們無處容身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能再走了，老陳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你連阿發的死，連那麼多為了龍門城死去的人......都可以裝作沒看到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"別覺得自己很懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他們處的時間比你久得多，我對他們的理解比你深得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但保護龍門是我的職責。不管誰攔在我面前，我的職責，從來沒變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"還當自己是陳警司？你的職責是誰給你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......我都不知道你是不是想把這話說給自己聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看你，一個人就救得了龍門？一個人殺得了所有整合運動？耍脾氣要有個限度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"挺有意思。之前是你去執行魏先生的命令，因為你能理解他。現在，變了，是我來執行魏先生的命令，只因為現在我更理解魏先生一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概猜得到魏先生的辦法。既然有人要死，魏先生只會想自己去。你是陳家血脈，這件事過後，你不會受牽連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你說他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生寧願自己死，也不願意你死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他想得太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能也把他想得太不是東西了，老陳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他想死，那就去死好了。可他死了又能解決得了什麼？能有什麼用？難道戰爭就不會開始了？難道龍門就不會首當其衝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他死，龍門不會被人遷怒。我想所有的責任都會隨著他本人的死煙消雲散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能會這麼順利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不那麼順利。所以，他要你接班近衛局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你會接他的班。近衛局局長的位子遲早是你的，下一步，你會成為這座城市的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你該去把前前後後的問題，上上下下的遺毒，全都解開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚魏先生想做的事。他一直在等一個時機，他的眼神和他的手段，從我認識他那天開始就沒變過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門還需要你，龍門也不希望你冒這個險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我只感覺到一陣噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生的死也許打動不了你，但他死後，你可以去改變這座龍門城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你一個事實吧，星熊。一個我不屬於這座城市的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"別騙我，老陳。沒人比你更適合這座城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼時候......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞞著我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是故意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼連我都不能知道......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾不希望任何人知道。近衛局不能有感染者，所以我不能是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，這座城市沒有感染者的容身之地。這片大地也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經受夠了魏彥吾對我們的操控。我不會再由著他去指使我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我總算......總算完完全全地明白，為什麼你，老陳，為什麼你不能離開龍門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......星熊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是走了，去了核心城，魏先生就不得不把你劃成敵人，你不僅是敵人，而且你必須是一個感染者，一個與龍門敵對的危險感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"整座城就都會知道你是感染者，甚至還會認為你和整合運動同謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"覆水難收，你再也回不了這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話是我該說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“你是感染者？我不在乎。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎，Missy她不在乎，九也不在乎，近衛局也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至魏先生都不在乎。他想讓你改變這裡，而不是趕走你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒看到他對感染者的無情，我看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"至於九，她已經走了。之前她離開近衛局，是因為她也被感染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......九也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想想，我和九也許是因為同個任務患上的礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她後來是我的線人，表面上加入了整合運動......然後，為了整合運動，她拋棄了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因為她看清了這座城市的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"但你根本沒背叛龍門。我不會讓你背上你沒犯下的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，你覺得......你覺得我為什麼要去核心城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"猜謎我對付不來，說明白點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道整合運動的領袖是誰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她的名字我記不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Missy沒告訴過你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉是我的姐姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。啊.......哈。我懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，你今天不可能過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼說這種話......？難道我的親人、我的家人......都不夠重要？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為這樣我才不能讓你過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"即使今天我要死在這裡，我也不會讓你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這事情不是你能決定的，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"般若決定得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——今天擋在我面前，哪怕是場天災，我也不會乖乖束手就擒，何況是一面盾，一個鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"鑄造這面盾的工匠被一群流浪的惡鬼殺了滿門，他的怨氣可比天災還怨毒得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"而這面盾上沾上的鮮血、引起的慘劇......比起天災都邪惡得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，魏先生不是個好人，我們可以合起來打他一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼想做的，我陪你去，什麼都行。你不是喜歡我那輛哥倫比亞大缸70vv嗎？我讓給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，不要是現在。不要去。不要逼我。這是我最後一點點想你答應的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"逼你？你怎麼說話像魏彥吾一樣？......不要這麼說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在魏彥吾動手的時候......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"早在他出賣自己兄弟、辜負我的母親、讓這座城市在他灰暗的罪惡裡沉睡時，我就已經決定好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾怎麼做，也許你覺得和你有關係，但我覺得和你沒有一點關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他所做的、為你做的，和你該做的，一直是兩回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生也是這麼期望的。他不想做一個壞人，他渴望的不是統治......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他把劍給了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你根本就不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——理解什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不止一次，一次，一次又一次......我毀掉自己的家，毀掉自己的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"每次我都沾了一身血，每次我都打到最後，打到只剩我一個人站著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為我覺得這是對的。就因為我認定那是錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我常常會想，我配活下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不配。但我還是活下來了。我沒法再只為自己活著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"認定對錯，所以一腳踏出去......是人一生中能做的最蠢的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"後悔的味道一直就留在我的嘴裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為只有你背負了很多嗎，陳大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要這麼說話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......那為什麼不能稍微理解我一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我們同甘共苦這麼些年，到底有什麼不能敞開說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我有苦衷，你也有，我們都清楚，可明明知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可你為什麼還是不明白？我沒有牽連你們任何一個人，我到底哪裡沒理解你們？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我見過太多死得毫無價值的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎你的身份，但我在乎你去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你去。敵人的頭領做到現在這步，你幹什麼都改變不了現狀，你會白死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你白死，沒人想看到。整個近衛局，整個龍門，沒人想看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——謝謝你，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但我一定要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"當真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真要出劍，我不會怕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要過，是嗎？你是不是覺得自己現在的心硬得像塊鐵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前就和你說過，你會沉浸在自己一個人的想法裡，看不到周圍的一切，看不到別人為你努力了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一意孤行只會害了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了。只有被狠狠捶打過一遍，你才會像過去的我一樣，知道自己那些可笑的執著都不過是些衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你想打，老陳......就讓我看看你比起過去兩年成長了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不 要 這 麼 說 話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"EX-42 源石技藝遠程操作型器械，使用者迷迭香，請批准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"允許在防衛戰中運用，已批准帶離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"運用人：殲滅戰專員，羅德島精英幹員迷迭香，已批准開啟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那我去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島艦船的啟動，麻煩你們轉告可露希爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，快快，快退進艙門。別看啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是你被迷迭香戰鬥時射出來的碎片打到，很可能會死喔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
